 This problem involves finding the volume of a sphere that circumscribes a cylinder with a given volume. Let's denote the radius of the cylinder by \(r\) and the height by \(h\). The volume of the cylinder is given by the formula: \[
V = \pi r^2 h = 60 \text{ cubic centimeters}
\] The sphere that circumscribes the cylinder will have a diameter equal to the diagonal of the rectangular prism (formed by the height and the diameter of the circular base of the cylinder). The radius of the sphere \(R\) will be half of this diagonal. The diagonal of the rectangular prism is \(\sqrt{(2r)^2 + h^2} = \sqrt{4r^2 + h^2}\). So the radius of the sphere is \(R = \frac{1}{2} \sqrt{4r^2 + h^2}\). The volume of the sphere is given by the formula: \[
V_{\text{sphere}} = \frac{4}{3} \pi R^3 = \frac{4}{3} \pi \left( \frac{1}{2} \sqrt{4r^2 + h^2} \right)^3 = \frac{4}{3} \pi \left( \frac{1}{8} (4r^2 + h^2)^{3/2} \right) = \frac{1}{6} \pi (4r^2 + h^2)^{3/2}
\] We need to find \( \frac{1}{6} \pi (4r^2 + h^2)^{3/2} \). However < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < < <

